WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in A crumbling crystalline memory-world, high above a void., desperate.

2
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.300 align:center
Lyra: Falling! Hold!

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.600 align:center
Kael: Too high... always too high.

4
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:10.900 align:center
Lyra: Not an option.

5
