Echo Shard: Release it. Release yourself.

6
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:21.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in A precarious ledge formed from fragmented memories, overlooking the void., urgent.

7
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:22.800 align:center
Lyra: Ledge. Cover. Now.

8
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.100 align:center
