9
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.400 align:center
Lyra: I know. Stay dark.

10
00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:28.700 align:center
Echo Shard: You cannot hide.

11
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:38.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in A narrow, dead-end corridor within the memory structure, walls shimmering with faded images., desperate.

12
00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.300 align:center
Lyra: Trapped. No way out.

13
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:42.600 align:center
Kael: The walls remember... too much.

14
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:44.900 align:center
Lyra: Move! Find a seam!

15
00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:47.200 align:center
Echo Shard: The end is here.

16
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:53.500 align:center
♪ at dawn, in The collapsing corridor, now breached by Echo Shards., urgent.

17
00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:54.800 align:center
Lyra: They're through! Attack!

18
00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:57.100 align:center
