19
00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:59.400 align:center
Lyra: No! Don't waste it!

20
00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:01.700 align:center
Echo Shard: Resistance is... a memory.

21
00:01:02.1000 --> 00:01:07.1000 align:center
♪ at dawn, in The corridor, now quieter but beginning to twist., tense.

22
00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:09.300 align:center
