Lyra: What is this place?

25
00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:16.200 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: A new pattern. For you.

26
00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:22.500 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in A vast, open chamber where reality unravels., dread.

27
00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:24.800 align:center
