Kael: The Loom. It remembers me.

29
00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:29.400 align:center
Lyra: What does it want?

30
00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:30.700 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Order. From chaos.

31
00:01:31.1000 --> 00:01:37.1000 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in The Loom's Labyrinth, a constantly shifting maze of memory-fragments., desperate.

32
00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:40.300 align:center
Lyra: It moves! Always changing!

33
00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.600 align:center
