34
00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:44.900 align:center
Lyra: No rhythm! Just chaos!

35
00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:46.200 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Embrace the weave.

36
00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:53.500 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in Deep within the Loom's Labyrinth, glimpses of a core memory., urgent.

37
00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:55.800 align:center
Lyra: I see it! The core!

38
00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:58.100 align:center
Kael: Hold the image... don't lose it.

39
00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:00.400 align:center
Lyra: Almost there. Must reach it!

40
00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:02.700 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: It is mine now.

41
00:02:03.1000 --> 00:02:10.1000 align:center
♪ at dusk, in The core of the memory, a nexus of raw, vibrant energy, now under attack., dread.

42
