44
00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:16.900 align:center
Lyra: Not this one! Never!

45
00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:18.200 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: It always fades.

46
00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:25.500 align:center
♪ at dusk, in The core, a desperate struggle between Lyra and the Loom., desperate.

47
00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:26.800 align:center
Lyra: No! Release it!

48
00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:28.100 align:center
Kael: Sacrifice... to remember.

49
00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:29.400 align:center
Lyra: What?! Which one?

50
00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:31.700 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: All will be consumed.

51
00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:38.000 align:center
♪ at dusk, in The wounded core, Lyra alone with her losses., dread.

52
00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:40.300 align:center
Lyra: It's gone. My childhood home...

53
00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:42.600 align:center
Kael: The Loom... it tasted.

54
00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:44.900 align:center
Lyra: What did it taste?

55
00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:47.200 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Your path. Your destination.
